# Envio HyperIndex generates into .envio/ and build/ — regenerate with
# `pnpm codegen` (or `npm run codegen` standalone). See docs/indexer.md.
.envio/
build/
node_modules/
.env
*.log
# Local scratch probes: anything dropped here is throwaway. The exception is
# live-range.ts, which docs/indexer.md cites by name as the thing that produced
# its "Proven live runs" — a documented run nobody can re-run is a claim, not
# evidence. Note the `*`: git will not look inside a directory it has ignored,
# so `scripts/local/` with a trailing slash would make the negation below dead.
scripts/local/*
!scripts/local/live-range.ts
